[final spoiler warning]


































































I started the game fairly normal.  I did what I normally do - go to
minetown, then sokoban.  When I arrived at minetown, I found a
cross-aligned priest, so I left for sokoban.  At sokoban, I found my
bag of holding, and an amulet of lifesaving.  I then went back to the
mines, ran across a level with a mind flayer, and left, never to
return.  On my way back up, I found a magic lamp in minetown, and used
it to get SDSM.  It was promptly lost less than 2000 turns later after
an incident involving a nymph and a later one involving a werewolf.

I took a break, then had the idea:  Taste the three riders.  Soon it
turned into eat, then eat the riders and medusa.  I soon set up a
pudding farm specificly to accomplish that.

After I had 5 "oLS and 2 /oWishing, I shut down the farm and went for
medusa.  Not thinking well, I wandered into medusa's lair satiated and
wearing a =oSD.  Luckily, I had every useful ring in the game and was
able to tin her, and eat the tin.

I did some final preparations for my end game meal - taking out lichs
and sea creatures (mind flayers went earlier), then went on my way.
Nothing terribly significant happened on the way, though I did decide
to not dig out any paths through gehennom, or pay the demons, since it
was already easy enough.

I made one horrible mistake at the castle:  I forgot about the quest
artifact, noticd I didn't have any levitation, so I swam through the
moat, losing every scroll and potion I had.  I made up for it with some
alchemy at the old pudding farm (I never had to drink any of the
potions I made).

When I made it to the astral plane, I dperformed a final assessment of
my situation:  20-21 wishes available (3 wands - 0:2 0:3 0:3 and one
blessed magic lamp), 5 magic markers, and about 120 blank scrolls (the
moat) I started reading and writing create mosnter scrols, taming
scrolls, and charging scrolls, with a couple cursed confuse monster
scrolls as fast as I could.  The level filled up pretty fast with acid
blobs, so I soon went for famine in the middle.  I made the first
attempt at eating him, but some andt I tamed where acting up and
killnig my blobs.  I promptly wrote two blessed genocide scrolls and
took the ants and snakes out, then filled in the holes.  I'll be more
efficient if I do it again. - I only had at most 12 wishes left in the
end. (5 actual wishes, one failed lamp wish, 3 failed wand zaps (bad
luck from accidental pet killing))

Pestilence, Famine, and death where soon eaten.  They where delicious.

I finished by adjusting my score, to ascend with 44,444,444 points,
because very few if any people do that.

